<title>USA: Centennial Bancorp sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Centennial Bancorp sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>EUGENE, Ore. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centennial Bancorp said Thursday its board has has declared an 11-for-10 split of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>Distribution of additional shares will be made to shareholders of record as of July 31 and is scheduled for delivery on August 22, it said.</p>
<p>Centennial is a bank holding company organized in Eugene in 1981, whose principal subsidiary is Centennial Bank, also headquartered in Eugene.</p>
